			<item>
				<title>The New World</title>
				<link>https://example.org/2026/the-new-world/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 08:04:23 +0600</pubDate>
				<guid>https://example.org/2026/the-new-world/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The new world order is coming. But what does that even mean? Do I know it? I don&amp;rsquo;t think so. I am confused. But the new world order is coming. You won&amp;rsquo;t have to wait that much.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;What are we investing in right now? Are we doing anything meaningful right now? What&amp;rsquo;s the point? Are we doing everything correctly? There&amp;rsquo;s the confusion, doubt you name it. You can look into everything, something is not right. Is it the AI? Is it the rise of LLMs? Or is it the unnecessary war between US and it&amp;rsquo;s allies vs Iran? Or is it about the oil/gas price hike?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
