			<item>
				<title>Things Are Actually Difficult</title>
				<link>https://example.org/2025/things-are-actually-difficult/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 22:41:17 +0600</pubDate>
				<guid>https://example.org/2025/things-are-actually-difficult/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Things are actually quite difficult. As we move through the civilization and new&#xA;discovery our life becomes more and more sophisticated. We&amp;rsquo;re building and creating&#xA;things at astonishing speed. Keeping up with this is not easy! We need to work&#xA;harder than ever. But the payout is not always great. Sacrificing friend, family&#xA;and all the things just to work hard doesn&amp;rsquo;t make sense most of the time. Yet&#xA;here we are some of us just doing exactly that to survive. I think it&amp;rsquo;s not the right&#xA;way to live a life. It&amp;rsquo;s becoming too much. We need to strategize things a bit!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
