			<item>
				<title>The Negotiation Room</title>
				<link>https://example.org/2025/the-negotiation-room/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 16 Nov 2025 16:19:01 +0600</pubDate>
				<guid>https://example.org/2025/the-negotiation-room/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The boardroom fell silent after Clara’s &lt;strong&gt;ingenuous&lt;/strong&gt; proposal. Her idea was bold yet sincere, delivered without a hint of guile, but the CEO’s reaction was &lt;strong&gt;ambiguous&lt;/strong&gt; enough to leave everyone guessing.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Jonah, whose mood was famously &lt;strong&gt;mercurial&lt;/strong&gt;, leaned back in his chair as if weighing the merits. He found her plan compelling, but feared it might &lt;strong&gt;undermine&lt;/strong&gt; months of careful political maneuvering within the company.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Across the table, Mara gave a slight nod of approval—so slight it could be dismissed as an &lt;strong&gt;innocuous&lt;/strong&gt; gesture, though those who knew her understood it signaled deep support.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
